# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Raw source media — NOT shipped, NOT committed
#
# Originals the owner supplies (full-size PNG/JPEG renders, the source
# media folder, superseded product shots) live here. Only the optimised
# copy under /public is committed and deployed, so the repo Vercel builds
# from stays small. `node scripts/asset-audit.mjs` lists anything under
# /public the site no longer serves; `--move raw_assets` relocates it.
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
raw_assets/

# Reference imagery pulled from the inspiration sites during the audit.
# Licensed to their owners, never shipped, and never committed -- CLAUDE.md
# 7.4. It lived in a top-level images/ folder whose ignore rule was removed
# by mistake while tidying, which is how 11MB of it briefly got staged.
/images/

# Audit artifacts — screenshots and Lighthouse JSON from the revamp.
# 65MB of binaries that document a run rather than build the site. The
# write-ups in docs/revamp/*.md are the part worth keeping in git; the
# evidence behind them lives in raw_assets/audit-artifacts/.
docs/revamp/screenshots/
docs/revamp/lighthouse/
docs/revamp/lighthouse-after/
docs/revamp/lighthouse-v2/

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Misc tooling caches
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.tmp/
.cache/
.parcel-cache/
.eslintcache
.stylelintcache

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local task runner outputs (Claude Code)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/

# Vendored agent skills (reproducible from skills-lock.json)
.agents/


.next-prod/

# Playwright MCP scratch output (snapshots, console logs, ad-hoc screenshots)
.playwright-mcp/

# Scratch harnesses (the keepers are scripts/axe*.mjs, readability.mjs, shot.mjs)
scripts/.*.tmp.mjs
